{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>If you could change your memories of a tragic event by sacrificing your most treasured objects, which ones would you let go ?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2091, in a France scarred by massive forest fires, and a caste has achieved to rise at the top : the rainmakers. You were one of the most promising, before your life collapsed.\u00a0      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront painful memories through deeply meaningful minigames, recall the events attached to objects in your house, get closer to friends. You will need as much strength as you can to fight your inner demons once and for all.\u00a0   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful minigames</strong> telling their part of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive movement</strong> avoiding South/North/East/West design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two friends\u00a0</strong>with whom you can deepen your relationship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important\u00a0choices </strong>related to the objects you care about the most.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040140?t=1759257638","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040140?t=1759257638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040140/ab8b41a46853b4ceb08e6f6b61381d3f1ef324ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759257638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040140/ab8b41a46853b4ceb08e6f6b61381d3f1ef324ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759257638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game talks about trauma and death through dialogue, description and puzzle mechanics"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>If you could change your memories of a tragic event by sacrificing your most treasured objects, which ones would you let go ?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2091, in a France scarred by massive forest fires, and a caste has achieved to rise at the top : the rainmakers. You were one of the most promising, before your life collapsed.\u00a0      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront painful memories through deeply meaningful minigames, recall the events attached to objects in your house, get closer to friends. You will need as much strength as you can to fight your inner demons once and for all.\u00a0   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful minigames</strong> telling their part of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive movement</strong> avoiding South/North/East/West design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two friends\u00a0</strong>with whom you can deepen your relationship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important\u00a0choices </strong>related to the objects you care about the most.</p></li></ul>","developers":["F(r)ictions Ludiques"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040140/c8876e03e04a2398414ccbbc6ca3713f03764e4c/header.jpg?t=1759257638","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040140/1093149604/4bb75452c0114a705c46a27c6ef5f9161c6675eb/1758804608/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758835785","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040140/1093149604/4bb75452c0114a705c46a27c6